This could have two meanings;

(1) Kendall Jenner is famously one of the only Kardashian members to not have a surgically enhanced ass. Luda is saying like Kendall, he’s going to ‘pass on that ass,’ suggesting that he is going to pass up having sex with a girl.

(2) Kendall was recently slammed in the media for dating different NBA players. She responded to some tweets about her being passed around, and clarified that she was the one doing the passing.

If someone asks Wayne to pass the blunt, they had better be ready to wait. Wayne loves to smoke…



It’s not the first time Wayne has used the “pass/study” wordplay with reference to marijuana;

Pass that weed, like I studied.

This echoes similar lines from Drake’s “Back to Back';

yeah, trigger fingers turn to twitter fingers, you getting' bodied by a singing' nigga “You getting bodied by a singing nigga, I’m not the type of nigga that’ll type to nigga’s

Weezy may not consider himself a singer, but he certainly feels he’s a great skater.

